<title>USA: U.S. cash soymeal - Basis flat, awaiting report.</title>
<headline>U.S. cash soymeal - Basis flat, awaiting report.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1997-02-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Rail and truck soymeal offers were mostly unchanged Tuesday in quiet trade as end-users wait for supply and demand data from the U.S. Department of Agriculuture, dealers said.</p>
<p>&quot;Its pretty quiet,&quot; one Kansas-City-based dealer said. &quot;People are just waiting to see what the government has to say tomorrow.&quot;</p>
<p>USDA will release revised supply and demand forecasts on Wednesday at 0830 EST, and buyers were reluctant to make purchases before the report because the data could cause a large swing in prices, dealers said.</p>
<p>One Indiana dealer said his supplies of soymeal were tight and would remain that way through the weekend.</p>
<p>&quot;We're extremely tight and basically don't have anything to sell,&quot; the dealer said..  </p>
